Package: CLEAR
Type: Package
Title: Cell-type and Lineage-resolved Enhancer Architecture from GWAS-snATAC
Version: 0.90
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lefei", "Wang", email = "lefei.wang@qimrberghofer.edu.au",
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Quantifies cell-type and lineage specificity of chromatin
    accessibility at GWAS variant loci. Provides L2-based high-specificity
    and dominance annotations, combined peak summaries, lineage hierarchy
    construction, global rank enrichment, and standalone offline HTML reports.
    Per-cell and depth normalisation and accessibility filtering are optional.
    Signal categories are descriptive, not locus-level significance tests.
